{:edb/db-before-t 2207 :edb/db-after-t 2208 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535520 50 #inst "2026-10-14T06:56:20.641Z" 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186064259 1038 #edb/ref 17592186510720 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186064259 1040 #edb/ref 17592186510723 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510720 1068 #edb/ref 17592186510721 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510720 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510720 1071 "Find the **positive** $x$-coordinate of the point on the curve $y=- x^{3} + 42 x - 2$ whose tangent has a slope of $-6.$\n\n$x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510720 1072 #uuid "3fd03b4b-26b0-57a3-90b6-cf64c012470d" 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510720 1074 "Let $f(x)=- x^{3} + 42 x - 2.$ The slope of the tangent at the point $x$ is equal to $f^{\\prime}(x).$ Computing the derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf^{\\prime}(x) &= \\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\left(- x^{3} + 42 x - 2\\right) \\\\\n&= (-1)\\cdot 3\\cdot x^{2} + (42)\\cdot 1\\cdot 1 \\\\\n&= 42 - 3 x^{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now set $f^{\\prime}(x)=-6$ and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n42 - 3 x^{2} &= -6 \\\\\n48 - 3 x^{2} &= 0 \\\\\n- 3 \\left(x - 4\\right) \\left(x + 4\\right) &= 0 \\\\\nx &= -4,\\,4\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $x>0$, the required coordinate is $x=4.$" 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510721 1075 #edb/ref 17592186510722 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510721 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510721 1077 "field-1" 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510721 1078 #edb/ref 17592186510722 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510721 1079 #uuid "dc755ef9-cb44-5175-b229-7f7ea951429f" 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510722 1080 "4" 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [17592186510722 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535520 17592186045443 true] [1